<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tr">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>BKM Kitap — Pazartesi Brifingi · {{ monday_dmy }}</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.5;color:#222;max-width:780px;margin:0 auto;padding:20px;">

<div style="border-bottom:3px solid #c0392b;padding-bottom:12px;margin-bottom:20px;">
  <h1 style="color:#c0392b;margin:0 0 6px 0;font-size:24px;">BKM Kitap — Pazartesi Brifingi</h1>
  <div style="color:#666;font-size:14px;">
    <strong>{{ monday_dmy }}</strong> · Hafta {{ week_number }} ({{ week_start }}–{{ week_end }}) kapanışı<br>
    Veri kesim: {{ data_cutoff }} · Kaynak: EncoreMerkez (3 Bursa mağazası)<br>
    <em>Otomatik üretim: {{ generated_at }} (script v{{ script_version }})</em>
  </div>
</div>

{% if has_warnings %}
<div style="background:#fff8e1;border-left:4px solid #f39c12;padding:10px 14px;margin-bottom:20px;font-size:13px;">
<strong>Uyarılar:</strong>
<ul style="margin:6px 0;">
{% for w in warnings %}<li>{{ w }}</li>{% endfor %}
</ul>
</div>
{% endif %}

<h2 style="color:#2c3e50;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;padding-bottom:4px;">Özet</h2>
<table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-bottom:20px;font-size:13px;">
<tr><td style="padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;"><strong>Hafta net ciro</strong></td><td style="text-align:right;padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;"><strong>{{ week.net_ciro_fmt }} ₺</strong></td><td style="padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;color:{% if week.wow_pct > 0 %}#27ae60{% else %}#c0392b{% endif %};">WoW {{ week.wow_str }}</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;">Fiş adedi</td><td style="text-align:right;padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;">{{ week.fis_fmt }}</td><td style="padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;color:#666;">{{ week.fis_wow_str }}</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;">Sepet ortalaması</td><td style="text-align:right;padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;">{{ week.sepet_fmt }} ₺</td><td style="padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;color:#666;">{{ week.sepet_wow_str }}</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:6px;">Ay MTD ({{ mtd_label }})</td><td style="text-align:right;padding:6px;"><strong>{{ mtd.net_ciro_fmt }} ₺</strong></td><td style="padding:6px;color:#666;">{% if mtd.gerceklesme_pct %}gerçekleşme %{{ mtd.gerceklesme_pct }}{% else %}hedef yok{% endif %}</td></tr>
</table>

<h2 style="color:#2c3e50;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;padding-bottom:4px;">1) Mağaza Özeti — Hafta {{ week_number }}</h2>
<table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-bottom:20px;font-size:13px;">
<thead><tr style="background:#f5f5f5;">
<th style="padding:8px;text-align:left;border-bottom:2px solid #ddd;">Mağaza</th>
<th style="padding:8px;text-align:right;border-bottom:2px solid #ddd;">Fiş</th>
<th style="padding:8px;text-align:right;border-bottom:2px solid #ddd;">Net Ciro</th>
<th style="padding:8px;text-align:right;border-bottom:2px solid #ddd;">Sepet</th>
<th style="padding:8px;text-align:right;border-bottom:2px solid #ddd;">WoW Net</th>
</tr></thead>
<tbody>
{% for s in stores %}
<tr><td style="padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;"><strong>{{ s.name }}</strong> ({{ s.mekan_id }})</td><td style="text-align:right;padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;">{{ s.fis_fmt }}</td><td style="text-align:right;padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;">{{ s.net_ciro_fmt }}</td><td style="text-align:right;padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;">{{ s.sepet_fmt }} ₺</td><td style="text-align:right;padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;color:{% if s.wow_pct > 0 %}#27ae60{% else %}#c0392b{% endif %};">{{ s.wow_str }}</td></tr>
{% endfor %}
<tr style="background:#f9f9f9;font-weight:bold;"><td style="padding:8px;">TOPLAM</td><td style="text-align:right;padding:8px;">{{ week.fis_fmt }}</td><td style="text-align:right;padding:8px;">{{ week.net_ciro_fmt }}</td><td style="text-align:right;padding:8px;">{{ week.sepet_fmt }} ₺</td><td style="text-align:right;padding:8px;color:{% if week.wow_pct > 0 %}#27ae60{% else %}#c0392b{% endif %};">{{ week.wow_str }}</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>

<h2 style="color:#2c3e50;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;padding-bottom:4px;">2) Günlük Seyir</h2>
<table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-bottom:20px;font-size:13px;">
<thead><tr style="background:#f5f5f5;">
<th style="padding:6px;text-align:left;border-bottom:2px solid #ddd;">Gün</th>
<th style="padding:6px;text-align:right;border-bottom:2px solid #ddd;">Net Ciro</th>
<th style="padding:6px;text-align:right;border-bottom:2px solid #ddd;">Fiş</th>
<th style="padding:6px;text-align:right;border-bottom:2px solid #ddd;">Sepet</th>
</tr></thead>
<tbody>
{% for d in daily %}
<tr {% if d.is_special %}style="background:#fff3cd;"{% endif %}><td style="padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;">{{ d.gun_label }}{% if d.special_note %} — <strong>{{ d.special_note }}</strong>{% endif %}</td><td style="text-align:right;padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;">{{ d.net_ciro_fmt }}</td><td style="text-align:right;padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;">{{ d.fis_fmt }}</td><td style="text-align:right;padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;">{{ d.sepet_fmt }} ₺</td></tr>
{% endfor %}
<tr style="background:#f9f9f9;font-weight:bold;"><td style="padding:6px;">TOPLAM</td><td style="text-align:right;padding:6px;">{{ week.net_ciro_fmt }}</td><td style="text-align:right;padding:6px;">{{ week.fis_fmt }}</td><td style="text-align:right;padding:6px;">{{ week.sepet_fmt }} ₺</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>

<h2 style="color:#2c3e50;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;padding-bottom:4px;">3) Ay MTD ({{ mtd_label }})</h2>
<table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-bottom:20px;font-size:13px;">
<thead><tr style="background:#f5f5f5;">
<th style="padding:8px;text-align:left;border-bottom:2px solid #ddd;">Mağaza</th>
<th style="padding:8px;text-align:right;border-bottom:2px solid #ddd;">MTD Net</th>
<th style="padding:8px;text-align:right;border-bottom:2px solid #ddd;">Hedef</th>
<th style="padding:8px;text-align:right;border-bottom:2px solid #ddd;">Gerçek %</th>
</tr></thead>
<tbody>
{% for m in mtd_stores %}
<tr><td style="padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;">{{ m.name }}</td><td style="text-align:right;padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;">{{ m.net_fmt }}</td><td style="text-align:right;padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;">{% if m.hedef %}{{ m.hedef_fmt }}{% else %}—{% endif %}</td><td style="text-align:right;padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;color:{{ m.pct_color }};">{% if m.gerceklesme_pct %}%{{ m.gerceklesme_pct }}{% else %}—{% endif %}</td></tr>
{% endfor %}
<tr style="background:#f9f9f9;font-weight:bold;"><td style="padding:8px;">TOPLAM</td><td style="text-align:right;padding:8px;">{{ mtd.net_ciro_fmt }}</td><td style="text-align:right;padding:8px;">{% if mtd.hedef %}{{ mtd.hedef_fmt }}{% else %}—{% endif %}</td><td style="text-align:right;padding:8px;">{% if mtd.gerceklesme_pct %}%{{ mtd.gerceklesme_pct }}{% else %}—{% endif %}</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>

<h2 style="color:#2c3e50;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;padding-bottom:4px;">4) Önümüzdeki Hafta — Hafta {{ next_week_number }}</h2>
<p style="font-size:13px;color:#555;">{{ next_week_note }}</p>

<h2 style="color:#2c3e50;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;padding-bottom:4px;">Kapsam Uyarıları</h2>
<ul style="font-size:13px;color:#555;line-height:1.6;">
<li>Kapsam: 3 Bursa fiziksel mağaza (FSM, Özlüce, İst.Yolu) — Heykel, JOKER e-ticaret, kitapsepeti, kafeler dahil değil</li>
<li>Geri dönüşüm fişleri (BarcodeNo='1001') hariç</li>
<li>İade fişleri sign'lı (negatif) ciroya dahil</li>
<li>AI yorumu opsiyonel — bu rapor ham veridir, derinlemesine analiz için Claude oturumda ek yorum eklenebilir</li>
</ul>

<hr style="margin:30px 0;border:none;border-top:1px solid #ddd;">
<p style="font-size:11px;color:#999;text-align:center;">
BKM Kitap · Pazartesi Brifingi (otomatik) · {{ generated_at }}<br>
Veri kesim: {{ data_cutoff }} · scripts/generate_brief.py v{{ script_version }}<br>
Sonraki brief: {{ next_monday_dmy }} 09:00
</p>

</body>
</html>
